  "releaseNotes": "Alpha. Every failure now carries a TmuxDispatchState, so a caller can tell a retry that repeats nothing from one that repeats a side effect: catch (LibTmuxException e) when (e.Dispatch == TmuxDispatchState.NotDispatched). The parsers gained fuzz coverage, and the performance claims are now recorded runs with their tmux, host and date rather than bare milliseconds. The public API is not settled and may change without notice between prereleases; pin an exact version. Full history: https://github.com/libtmux/libtmux-dotnet/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md",
